{"id": "ho_consonant_join", "signature": "solve(text)", "statement": "Given a string `text`, look at each character in order. Keep a character only if it is an ASCII letter (a-z or A-Z) and is not a vowel (a, e, i, o, u, in either case). Convert each kept character to uppercase and concatenate them, in order, with no separator. Digits, spaces, punctuation and non-ASCII letters are dropped. Return the empty string if nothing is kept.", "tests": [{"args": [""], "expected": ""}, {"args": ["aeiou"], "expected": ""}, {"args": ["Hello, World!"], "expected": "HLLWRLD"}, {"args": ["Python 3.12"], "expected": "PYTHN"}, {"args": ["rhythm"], "expected": "RHYTHM"}, {"args": ["AbcXyz"], "expected": "BCXYZ"}, {"args": ["  "], "expected": ""}, {"args": ["naïve café"], "expected": "NVCF"}, {"args": ["Programming Language"], "expected": "PRGRMMNGLNGG"}, {"args": ["queue"], "expected": "Q"}, {"args": ["Zz"], "expected": "ZZ"}], "facts": [["arg", "text", "string"], ["iterate", "text"], ["keep", "consonant"], ["map", "upper"], ["aggregate", "join"], ["size", "text", "tiny"]], "deps": {"schema": ["seq_fold"], "uses": [], "solution_sha256": "1d0ab580e7dcfe0f78dc9b6a097b9c7039c96722a4511d45aa88c27d650c0346", "reference_sha256": "a33ae9a3685c619c4754c5aafa944acd820fcec970c2fcea28bc33724f88e168"}}